<title>USA: IPO PRICING - Chicago prices below range.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - Chicago prices below range.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	Chicago Bridge &amp; Iron Co NV</p>
<p>   Priced At					 $18</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	     $19 - $20</p>
<p>   Number of Shares		     10,500,000</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter		CS First Boston</p>
<p>NOTE: The company lowered the estimated price range for its planned initial public offering to $19 to $20 from an earlier range of $23 to $20.</p>
</text>
